Third-party material
--------------------

Parts of this project are adapted from, or based on data from, the following works:

* Freenove ESP32-S3 Display (FNK0104) example code
  https://github.com/Freenove/Freenove_ESP32_S3_Display
  Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 3.0 (CC BY-NC-SA 3.0).
  Used: the ST77922 panel initialization register sequence and pin assignments (src/panel.cpp),
  the touch-controller register layout (src/panel.cpp), and the ES8311 codec pin assignments.

* Espressif es8311 codec driver (as distributed in the Freenove examples)
  Used: the ES8311 register initialization sequence and clock coefficients (src/audio.cpp).

* Meshpoint by KMX415
  https://github.com/KMX415/meshpoint
  Licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0.
  Used: the Meshtastic hardware-model name table (src/hw_names.h, from
  frontend/js/meshtastic_hw_names.js, credited there to javastraat/meshpoint), the dashboard
  colour palette, and the REST API this display consumes.

Libraries used at build time (fetched by PlatformIO, not included in this repository):
LovyanGFX (FreeBSD license), ArduinoJson (MIT), WiFiManager (MIT), Arduino-ESP32 (LGPL-2.1).
